This is a "bidir" JavaScript example. It is a trivial adaptation/simplification of
[1] to our Printer interface.

This example requires a "bidir server", not to be confused with the "BidirAdapter".

This example shows invocation from browser to standard Ice Server (C++, Python, ...)
and viceversa.

Procedure:

- Install DEPENDS
- Run a "bidir" server:
  py/bidir$ ./server.py --Ice.Config=server-ws.config
- Execute "make run-server"
- Open http://localhost:8080 and click "Start"

[1] https://github.com/zeroc-ice/ice-demos/tree/3.7/js/Ice/bidir
